DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_A971_4DF0';
<p>a971_4df0</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #845011;">Gene H</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #845011;"><i>horsey</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #845011;">Gene H</span> is quite big and strong-looking, much larger than your typical fruit fly.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #116b6c;">Gene R</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #116b6c;"><i>rusty</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #116b6c;">Gene R</span> has a reddish-brown color, much like rusted iron metal.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene Y</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #7441a6;"><i>yucky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #7441a6;">Gene Y</span> gives off an unpleasant odor and has a generally unappealing look.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, rusty, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">r</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,000</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, rusty</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">r</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,489</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,679</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">853</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">rusty, yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">r</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">871</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">rusty</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">r</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,478</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">yucky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f2e4ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">y</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">4,479</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #7441a6;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,151</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">30,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>H</b> and <b>Y</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>H</b> and <b>Y</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_A971_4DF0
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(5,000 + 5,151)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>10,151</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.3384 = <strong>33.84 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(853 + 4,478 + 4,479 + 4,489)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>14,299</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.4766 = <strong>47.66 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(853 + 871 + 4,478 + 4,479)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>10,681</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.3560 = <strong>35.60 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(853 + 871 + 4,479 + 4,489)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>10,692</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.3564 = <strong>35.64 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(853 + 871 + 5,000 + 5,151)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>11,875</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.3958 = <strong>39.58 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(871 + 4,489 + 4,679 + 5,151)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>15,190</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.5063 = <strong>50.63 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(853 + 871 + 4,479 + 4,489)</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = <sup>10,692</sup>/<sub>30,000</sub> = 0.3564 = <strong>35.64 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A971_4DF0_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
